<mxCell id="p1_B" value="updateDualMove()&lt;br&gt;두 축 위치·속도 read&lt;br&gt;5회 연속 도착 판정" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="255" y="680" width="200" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p1_C" value="updateSequenceMove()&lt;br&gt;Y(tilt) 도착 → X(pan) 출발&lt;br&gt;(홈 복귀 / 위치 복원)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="470" y="680" width="230" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p1_S" value="도착 완료 → savePosition()  (EEPROM 기록)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="255" y="790" width="445" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p1_Ln" value="• 레지스터를 축마다 따로 읽고/씀 (각 timeout 30ms)&lt;br&gt;• 상태 점검 read가 Bus Watchdog을 리셋하므로 v 타임아웃은 소프트웨어로 따로 검사&lt;br&gt;• 이동 명령(v, DX DY, h)은 command() 안에서 바로 모터에 기록" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#d6b656;rounded=0;align=left;spacingLeft=10;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="860" width="660" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p1_R1" value="loop()" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;rounded=1;arcSize=40;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="990" y="130" width="140" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p1_R2" value="command_active &amp;&amp;&lt;br&gt;(USB 끊김 || 200ms 동안 v 없음)?" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;rhombus;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="195" width="320" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p1_R2y" value="stopMotion()" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;rounded=1;arcSize=40;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1260" y="210" width="200" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
